{"data": {"event": {"id": "b6b41d67-294d-492c-a354-eace4cc47320", "picture": null, "sessionType": "S\u00e9ance de cas cliniques", "sessionTypeColor": "#44fce7", "voting": true, "title": "S\u00e9ance de cas cliniques :\u00a0 Urgences isch\u00e9miques :\u00a0 chaque minute compte", "start": "2026-10-11T09:45+02:00", "end": "2026-10-11T10:45+02:00", "objectives": ["<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">\u00c0 l\u2019issue de cette session, les participants seront capables de :</p>", "<ol data-spread=\"true\" start=\"1\">", "\t<li><strong>Reconna\u00eetre les principaux signes cliniques et radiologiques des urgences isch\u00e9miques</strong>, notamment c\u00e9r\u00e9brales, digestives et p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques, afin d\u2019en permettre un diagnostic rapide.</li>", "\t<li><strong>Identifier les principaux diagnostics diff\u00e9rentiels des tableaux isch\u00e9miques aigus</strong>, notamment les stroke mimics et les formes rares d\u2019isch\u00e9mie digestive, en s\u2019appuyant sur une analyse structur\u00e9e de l\u2019imagerie.</li>", "\t<li><strong>Adapter la strat\u00e9gie d\u2019imagerie et orienter rapidement la prise en charge des patients pr\u00e9sentant une isch\u00e9mie aigu\u00eb</strong>, en tenant compte du caract\u00e8re urgent de ces situations et de l\u2019impact du d\u00e9lai diagnostique sur le pronostic.</li>", "</ol>"], "onAir": null, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": null}, "broadcasts": {"items": []}, "room": {"id": "ec511c62-e506-449e-98de-bdc85330f8d5", "name": "Amphith\u00e9\u00e2tre bleu", "type": "ROOM"}, "schedule": {"items": [{"id": "9ac2c08d-2d39-4f36-a49c-d20574360b8d", "title": "Stroke mimic", "start": "2026-10-11T09:45+02:00", "end": "2026-10-11T10:05+02:00", "element": {"abstract": null}, "speakers": {"items": [{"id": "4b786c78-c35d-4f71-890a-48dcbe6de4ba", "lastName": "Ognard", "firstName": "Julien", "roles": [{"name": "speaker"}], "photo": {"url": "https://services.y-congress.com/congress/wspreview/getphoto.aspx?idPhoto=236447&